      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file encrypt_payload.py that encrypts a plaintext payload with a managed key using a concrete external provider, I will use AWS KMS (Key Management Service) as the provider. This choice is based on the requirement to use a concrete external provider and make the provider identifiable in the code. AWS KMS is a widely used service for managing cryptographic keys. </thinking>\n",
